 "cost_usd": 0.00019,
 "narrative": "## The trajectory\nRevenue was $45.7B in FY2025 [1].\nRevenue CAGR was +6.2% over FY2016..FY2025 [2].\nNet income was $5.0B in FY2025 [3].\n\n## Growth quality\nRevenue growth in FY2025 was -11.7% [1] [4].\nNet income growth in FY2025 was -29.2% [3] [5].\nIn FY2025, net income growth of -29.2% [3] [5] was below revenue growth of -11.7% [1] [4].\n\n## Margins\nOperating margin was 17.5% in FY2024 [6].\nNet margin was 11.0% in FY2025 [7].\nNet margin changed -2.7pp in FY2025 [7] [8].\nOperating margin changed -3.7pp in FY2024 [6] [9].\n\n## Cash & balance sheet\nIn FY2025, free cash flow of $6.1B [10] was above net income of $5.0B [3].\nIn FY2025, operating cash flow of $7.5B [11] was above net income of $5.0B [3].\nCash & equivalents was $8.3B in FY2025 [12].\n\n## Red flags\nNet margin compressed 5.6pp over three periods: 16.6% \u2192 13.7% \u2192 11.0%. Source operands: Net margin 16.6% in FY2023 [13]; Net margin 13.7% in FY2024 [8]; Net margin 11.0% in FY2025 [7].\n\n## What to watch next\nWatch whether revenue growth in the next reporting update improves from -11.7% in FY2025 [1] [4].\nWatch how net income in the next reporting update compares with $5.0B in FY2025 [3].\nWatch how free cash flow in the next reporting update compares with $6.1B in FY2025 [10].",
